From 50d81443fe736fa6e972c102bceb9e3527563952 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sanjay Karinje <sanjay.karinje.8@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 27 Nov 2025 00:57:10 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] sc: Add AI Explain Formula feature for Calc

Adds AI-powered formula explanation accessible via:
- Tools menu: Explain Formula with AI
- Right-click context menu on formula cells

Features:
- Auto-explains when dialog opens (streamlined UX)
- Shows cell reference, formula, and plain English explanation
- Uses shared AI configuration (OpenAI-compatible API)
- Menu item disabled when cell has no formula

Uses same ENABLE_CURL conditional pattern as translate feature.

Change-Id: I54b79ad4ad38cda3e05035d8caf6a584d94a2f5d
